                "title": "Half Round Knob With Stepped Rose, Fusion 01-B1",
                "description": "Contemporary Brass Half-Round Knob with Stepped Rose Fusion 01-B1 - Simple in design, Fusion Hardware's Half-Round Knob with Stepped Rose is a high quality solid brass product built to last for years to come. It is available in 5 finishes; and it will fit 1-1/4 inch to 2 inch thick doors and has an optional backset for either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches.\r\n",
